      "name": {
        "es": "Chorro Arena",
        "en": "Sand Stream"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Crea una tormenta de arena al entrar en combate.",
        "en": "The weather changes to a sandstorm when this Pokémon enters battle and does not end unless cancelled by another weather condition.\n\nIf multiple Pokémon with this ability, Drizzle, Drought, or Snow Warning are sent out at the same time, the abilities will activate in order of Speed, respecting Trick Room.  Each ability's weather will cancel the previous weather, and only the weather summoned by the slowest of the Pokémon will stay.\n\nOverworld: If the lead Pokémon has this ability, the wild encounter rate is halved in a sandstorm."
      }
    },
    {
      "is_hidden": true,
      "name": {
        "es": "Nerviosismo",
        "en": "Unnerve"
      },
      "description": {
        "es": "Pone nervioso al rival y le impide usar bayas.",
        "en": "Opposing Pokémon cannot eat held Berries while this Pokémon is in battle.\n\nAffected Pokémon can still use Bug Bite or Pluck to eat a target's Berry."
      }
    }
  ],
